00:31:06.370 --> 00:31:08.110
and innovative announcements.

00:31:08.110 --> 00:31:11.500
And I just wanted to share that
maybe for those of you here

00:31:11.500 --> 00:31:14.050
and those online
it's those of you who

00:31:14.050 --> 00:31:15.940
are-- it's late on a Thursday.

00:31:15.940 --> 00:31:18.940
It may be that
savings in cloud spend

00:31:18.940 --> 00:31:21.520
is not the most exciting thing.

00:31:21.520 --> 00:31:25.180
But I can share with you that
I guarantee the more you use

00:31:25.180 --> 00:31:27.760
cloud-- and we hear
